					"local_notes": "Lore: An Autarch has fought inside enough different Aspects' own war-doctrines to match an Exarch's own evasion.\n\nDesign: A further Enhanced Dodge 1 (B51, 15 points), stacking with Aspect Training's own level for Enhanced Dodge 2 total, matching an Exarch's own tier.",
